Bottom line

This is a small +4 commit batch with no new executable software, but propicep adds a meaningful architectural reinforcement:

\boxed{
intelligence\ can\ operate\ over\ persistent\ embodied/spatial\ state\ without\ first\ becoming\ language.
}

i c adds the complementary principle:

\boxed{
language\ is\ not\ merely\ representation;\ it\ can\ act\ as\ a\ state-transition interface.
}

Together they sharpen Pantheon into a system with both pre-linguistic embodied control and symbolically mediated control, while the Genesis artifacts are best retained as structural/mythopoetic demonstrations of pattern induction—not historical or ontological claims. 